  "name": "mmu_gaia_gaia",
  "description": "\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tmmu_gaia_gaia HATS Catalog Collection\n\t\n\nThis is the collection of HATS catalogs representing mmu_gaia_gaia.\nThis dataset is part of the Multimodal Universe,\na large-scale collection of multimodal astronomical data. For full details, see the paper:\nThe Multimodal Universe: Enabling Large-Scale Machine Learning with 100TBs of Astronomical Scientific Data.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAccess the catalog\n\t\n\nWe recommend the use of the LSDB Python framework to access HATS catalogs.\nLSDB can be\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/UniverseTBD/mmu_gaia_gaia.",
